 "section_summary": "This section contains the concluding portion (internal pages 155–187) of a comprehensive statistical roster of educational institutions in Osaka Prefecture compiled by SCAP's Civil Information and Education Section, covering private youth schools, elementary schools, kindergartens, and miscellaneous vocational schools, as well as specialized training institutes operated under other Japanese government ministries as of April and November 1946. The report concludes with summary statistics and a reference map of Central Honshu depicting administrative boundaries, major cities, and institutions of higher education. The final page is a State Department cover despatch dated October 5, 1948, from the U.S. Political Adviser in Tokyo transmitting Part 33 of the same educational roster series covering Saga Prefecture.",
